  "rule": "A judge with kind=llm may block only when human_agreement.n >= 30 and human_agreement.kappa >= 0.4. Deterministic judges encode a rule and may block. The nightly agreement job (/api/eval/judge-agreement) fills human_agreement from evals/labels.jsonl joined with evals/verdicts.jsonl.",
